<p>Ae qaake paak hurmate mehmaa'n nigahdaar<br />
Khoda na jaaye asghare masoom ka mazaar</p>

<p>Aye arze karbala na rulana sagheer ko<br />
kul cheh mahine ka hai abhi sheh ka gullezaar</p>

<p>Aye teere zulm dena gawaahi tu hashr me<br />
Be jurm hurmula ne kiya hai jigar figaar</p>

<p>Aulaad walo syede bekas ka saath do<br />
Faryaad kar rahe hai hussaine falak weqaar</p>

<p>Ummat ke baqsh waane ki qaatir hue shaheed<br />
Asghar tumhari choti si mayyat ke mai nisaar</p>

<p>Shoukat wahi hua jo muqaddar me tha likha<br />
Asghar ke sar ko kaat liya khod kar mazaar<br />
</p>